{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "82922c56709ee87a908d2c0743ff3ab4bf0226cda86eab15d467092fe3146937", "ja": "（あずささんに新衣装の感想を聞きに行ったのだが、\n何やら人が集まっており、一度出直してきた……）", "zh": "（本来想去问梓小姐对新服装的感想，\n却发现不知怎么聚集了不少人，只好先回来一趟……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "4f36e3c1722d9ed60b7a07d39cf47b3c1870fabb84e83018c150b237fafa9f96", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nすみません～、お待たせしてしまって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n不好意思～让您久等了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7e60bd5e2419b2c869cda1cf770fa4dd093df1df6b25a03b10598bae28a5a808", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ。\n大盛況でしたね、『あずさのお悩み相談室』。", "zh": "没关系的。\n“梓的烦恼咨询室”办得非常红火呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "469d87af09355fd85177c9d95619312fa070b1fef01577f17d85e2047a55443e", "ja": "私も驚きました～。シスターの役作りになればと、\n軽い気持ちでみんなに声をかけたのに……。", "zh": "我也很惊讶呢～。本来只是想着为演好修女这个角色做准备，抱着轻松的心情邀请大家的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "678781c2560f48d0f44fc1d7d7f802f8d0bcb8a7e9e5ef32b93fe79b534a6748", "ja": "まさか、こんなにも集まってくれるなんて。\nでも、すごくありがたかったです。", "zh": "真没想到，居然能来这么多人。\n不过，我真的很感激大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "17c526e24538dab619ff27fa51c3e195c1ba8775d287beb3bd3dcfb6f90a89a6", "ja": "いろんなお話を聞かせてもらって……途中から\nほとんど雑談みたいでしたけどね。うふふっ。", "zh": "听你们讲了各种各样的事情……不过从中途开始，几乎都像是在闲聊了呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4635b99e9366b15ee729f6cce124066b279c6344d80631580905922ee1ff0305", "ja": "それだけ今日のあずささんが、\nいつも以上に話しやすかったということでしょうね。", "zh": "也就是说，今天的阿梓莎小姐比平时更容易让人聊得来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "36ede717dd970641e60d3f5a135e09a65ab16211481c3d855829f79025ed2a92", "ja": "まあ。そうだと嬉しいです。もちろん、\n本物のシスターさんには及びませんけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。要是那样的话，我会很开心的。当然，还是比不上真正的修女……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1008_p", "source_sha256": "29c2c90ed5d1408f52358638a6f1cccc70a97478f94aa2448a5c618035747379", "ja": "そんな。遠目から見ただけでもわかるぐらい、\n本物さながらのシスターぶりでしたよ。", "zh": "哪儿的话。即使只是远远看了一眼，也能看出您扮演修女的样子和真正的修女一模一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "1326c97bcbdd9607e88ea09e27a06bdf11278065e74fb84731b34b5be31f4c48", "ja": "ありがとうございます、そう言っていただけて、光栄\nです♪　……あ、でも。だとすると、どうしましょう。", "zh": "谢谢您，能得到您这样的评价，我很荣幸♪\n……啊，不过，要是那样的话，该怎么办呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "67c8a9b07e34122d1732b507a6b4c0c253626895116dce15f456eeb54b4b9c5c", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}さん。今日の私は、\nみんなのお悩みを聞いて、導く立場ですけど……。", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生。虽说我今天\n的任务是倾听大家的烦恼并指引他们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "97a6052dadf016ebcdd0d5492abdef409a08207fbf5711fb3e41d1ebcb25e15e", "ja": "そんな私が、{$P$}さんに相談を\nするのは、おかしいでしょうか……？", "zh": "像我这样的人，向{$P$}先生寻求帮助，会不会很奇怪呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1012_p", "source_sha256": "40a10efaf07b008108497dea1557cda1d08b5b5325c923bf1f1cae91e12c1447", "ja": "そんなことないですよ。どれだけ立派なシスターで\nあっても、あずささんは、あずささんですからね。", "zh": "没那回事。不管是多么优秀的修女，あずさ小姐始终还是あずさ小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "df65b51af20465f49ea6bcc4d5b89fc9e964daab1971d1a1b5e17a3ca4e15aed", "ja": "うふふ、よかったです。ではお言葉に甘えて。\n実は今日、ずっと聞きたかったことがあって……。", "zh": "呵呵，太好了。那我就恭敬不如从命了。\n其实今天，我一直有件事想问您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "6db7ba0219cfbe7cbae2f5ac5771540222f723041b004eab270c85c480066584", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nどうでしょうか？　……この衣装を着た私は。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n您觉得怎么样？……穿着这身服装的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cc772b1a344b718a6799ac53f9292ff37392703175ae2169c2a3d4116e0cbb84", "ja": "えっ！　それはもちろん、すごく似合っていて、\nとても素敵だと思いますよ！", "zh": "咦！那当然非常适合您，\n我觉得特别好看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "5be540a1ae14755b8155b3766b8853b5f5b3e98ee9021afa7fc820ca45b5fae5", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　{$P$}さん\nの感想を聞きたいなと、実はずっと思っていて……。", "zh": "谢谢您♪其实我一直很想听听您对{$P$}先生\n的感想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0434_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "b8e0f8ed61eabe1d8af0d4bf43c9344712b6af1f184dac006260f27ee810a6b7", "ja": "思い切って相談してよかったです。\n私のお悩み、すっきり解決です♪", "zh": "鼓起勇气找您商量真是太好了。\n我的烦恼全都彻底解决啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
